        <description>&lt;h3&gt;Fixed&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quit no longer cancels when Spire cannot clean up its app-owned MCP helper. Suspended cleanup has a three-second deadline while the main run loop remains responsive.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Late cleanup completion and repeated Quit requests share one termination decision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pairing preserves trust registry changes made while remote verification is in progress.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Added&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Explicit fleet observe, pair, status, and check commands share the application&amp;#x27;s pairing implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</description></item>
